# qlfile — dependency manifest for the CI environment.
#
# This file is read by Qlot, which is what the GitHub Actions we use
# (40ants/setup-lisp@v4 and 40ants/run-tests@v2) run everything inside.
# Qlot needs an explicit entry for every dependency that cannot be resolved
# from the Quicklisp distribution.
#
# Local development does NOT use Qlot: dev.lisp and run-tests.lisp use plain
# Quicklisp, with cl-cm checked out under ~/quicklisp/local-projects/cl-cm.
#
# cl-cm is not on Quicklisp. It is a public GitHub repository, so it is
# pulled here as a git source. The :ref pins an exact commit so that CI
# builds are reproducible; to pick up newer cl-cm commits, update the hash
# below (e.g. `git -C ~/quicklisp/local-projects/cl-cm rev-parse origin/main`).

git cl-cm https://github.com/sovelten/cl-cm.git :ref 13f2b928b4850ef5181027212625c78f71f0208b
